#: i18n_strings.py:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Submit a new suggestion.\n"
"        \n"
"        You can type the suggestion directly or use the interactive modal.\n"
"        \n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]suggest Add more emojis to the server`\n"
"        - `[p]suggest` (opens a modal to write)\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Enviar una nueva sugerencia.\n"
"\n"
"        Puedes escribirla directamente o usar el formulario interactivo.\n"
"\n"
"        **Ejemplos:**\n"
"        - `[p]suggest Añadir más emojis al servidor`\n"
"        - `[p]suggest` (abre un formulario para escribir)\n"
"        "

#: i18n_strings.py:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Edit your own suggestion (only if pending).\n"
"        \n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]editsuggest #123 New text for my suggestion`\n"
"        - `[p]editsuggest 1234567890 New text`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Editar tu propia sugerencia (solo si está pendiente).\n"
"\n"
"        **Ejemplos:**\n"
"        - `[p]editsuggest #123 Nuevo texto de mi sugerencia`\n"
"        - `[p]editsuggest 1234567890 Nuevo texto`\n"
"        "

#: i18n_strings.py:13
msgid "View your own suggestions."
msgstr "Ver tus propias sugerencias."

#: i18n_strings.py:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Approve a suggestion.\n"
"        \n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]approve #123`\n"
"        - `[p]approve #123 Great idea, we'll implement it`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Aprobar una sugerencia.\n"
"\n"
"        **Ejemplos:**\n"
"        - `[p]approve #123`\n"
"        - `[p]approve #123 Gran idea, la implementaremos`\n"
"        "

#: i18n_strings.py:15
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Deny a suggestion.\n"
"        \n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]deny #123`\n"
"        - `[p]deny #123 Not feasible at this time`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Rechazar una sugerencia.\n"
"\n"
"        **Ejemplos:**\n"
"        - `[p]deny #123`\n"
"        - `[p]deny #123 Ahora mismo no es viable`\n"
"        "

#: i18n_strings.py:16
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Change the status of a suggestion.\n"
"        \n"
"        **Available statuses:**\n"
"        pending, in_review, planned, in_progress, approved, implemented, denied, duplicate, wont_do\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Cambiar el estado de una sugerencia.\n"
"\n"
"        **Estados disponibles:**\n"
"        pending, in_review, planned, in_progress, approved, implemented, denied, duplicate, wont_do\n"
"        "

#: i18n_strings.py:17
msgid "List server suggestions."
msgstr "Listar las sugerencias del servidor."

#: i18n_strings.py:18
msgid "View detailed information about a suggestion."
msgstr "Ver información detallada de una sugerencia."

#: i18n_strings.py:19
msgid "View the change history of a suggestion."
msgstr "Ver el historial de cambios de una sugerencia."

#: i18n_strings.py:20
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Pendiente"

#: i18n_strings.py:21
msgid "In Review"
msgstr "En revisión"

#: i18n_strings.py:22
msgid "Planned"
msgstr "Planeado"

#: i18n_strings.py:23
msgid "In Progress"
msgstr "En progreso"

#: i18n_strings.py:24
msgid "Approved"
msgstr "Aprobado"

#: i18n_strings.py:25
msgid "Implemented"
msgstr "Implementado"

#: i18n_strings.py:26
msgid "Denied"
msgstr "Rechazado"

#: i18n_strings.py:27
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "Duplicado"

#: i18n_strings.py:28
msgid "Won't Do"
msgstr "No se hará"

#: simplesuggestions.py:53
msgid ""
"\n"
"    A comprehensive suggestion system with interactive buttons, persistent voting,\n"
"    multiple statuses, and web control panel.\n"
"    \n"
"    By Killerbite95\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"Sistema completo de sugerencias con botones interactivos, votos persistentes,\n"
"    varios estados y panel de control web.\n"
"\n"
"    Por Killerbite95\n"
"    "

