#: simplesuggestions.py:802
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Permanently delete suggestions from the record.\n"
"        \n"
"        **Options:**\n"
"        - `deleted`: Delete suggestions marked as deleted\n"
"        \n"
"        **Usage:** `[p]suggestadmin purge deleted`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Borrar sugerencias del registro de forma permanente.\n"
"\n"
"        **Opciones:**\n"
"        - `deleted`: borra las sugerencias marcadas como borradas\n"
"\n"
"        **Uso:** `[p]suggestadmin purge deleted`\n"
"        "

#: simplesuggestions.py:812
msgid ""
"⚠️ This will permanently delete all suggestions marked as deleted.\n"
